","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids July to August, August to September and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025, January to February ran 17% of normal on the middle, and September to October ran 55%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 155% on the middle. Grid 27152 had its driest year in 1988 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
